# mouse: Mouse & Trackpad page. Check in each look.
ipc panels settings mouse
wait 2
shot mouse-top
note M1/M2: top of the page; no mouse in the arena so the footer reads "No mouse is connected. These settings apply when one is." in both; same groups, titles, texts and order as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 scroll 0 10
wait 1
shot mouse-scroll
note M1 cont.: scrolled; same groups, titles, texts, footers and order in both shells (Trackpad heading comes after More options).
# MANUAL: M1 click "More options" and shot to the end.
# MANUAL: M3 Shake: click Bigger, Ring, Off (positions from a shot): config findPointer.enabled true/style grow, then ring, then enabled false (style stays ring); same in both shells.
# MANUAL: M4 click "On click": detail "A window takes the keyboard when you click it, as on a Mac"; config mouse.focus "click".
# MANUAL: M5 drag Tracking speed to the right end: config mouse.speed 1 (steps of 0.05); Scroll speed steps of 0.1.
# MANUAL: M6 More options, click the Pointer boundaries control, shot the list, pick "Off": Corner reach row disappears; "Protect shared corners": it is back with "24 logical pixels from each corner".
# MANUAL: M7 change speed, focus, boundary; click Restore Defaults: every value back (#8), both shells.
ipc panels close
